              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">From State Line Station to a point located 0.04 miles southeast of intersection of Illinois-Indiana State Line and 118th Street, extended in Hammond, Indiana.</span>
            </td>
