          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="3" style="border-top:1pt solid #000000;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">From the Illinois-Indiana State Line east for a distance of 0.03 miles to a point located 0.04 miles southeast of intersection of Illinois-Indiana State Line and 118th Street, extended in Hammond, Indiana.</span>
            </td>
